Package: battery-top
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: nmon-style live dashboard for battery, CPU, memory and disk
 battery-top is a single, dependency-light ncurses dashboard showing live
 battery health (capacity, cycle count, charge/discharge rate, remaining
 time), CPU and memory utilization, per-disk I/O, and linked network
 interfaces, styled after IBM's nmon.
 .
 All data is read straight from /proc and /sys/class/power_supply on every
 refresh; the tool keeps no state of its own and talks to no other daemon.
